<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es" class="scroll-smooth">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Becas y Apoyos Financieros - <%= title %></title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=PT+Sans:wght@400;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <script>
    tailwind.config = {
      theme: {
        extend: {
          fontFamily: {
            body: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],
            headline: ['PT Sans', 'sans-serif'],
          },
          colors: {
            background: 'hsl(165 60% 97%)',
            foreground: 'hsl(171 80% 10%)',
            card: 'hsl(165 60% 97%)',
            'card-foreground': 'hsl(171 80% 10%)',
            popover: 'hsl(165 60% 97%)',
            'popover-foreground': 'hsl(171 80% 10%)',
            primary: 'hsl(171 95% 27%)',
            'primary-foreground': 'hsl(171 25% 95%)',
            secondary: 'hsl(169 53% 90%)',
            'secondary-foreground': 'hsl(171 95% 27%)',
            muted: 'hsl(169 53% 94%)',
            'muted-foreground': 'hsl(171 40% 30%)',
            accent: 'hsl(169 53% 41%)',
            'accent-foreground': 'hsl(171 25% 98%)',
            destructive: 'hsl(0 84.2% 60.2%)',
            'destructive-foreground': 'hsl(0 0% 98%)',
            border: 'hsl(171 20% 88%)',
            input: 'hsl(171 20% 88%)',
            ring: 'hsl(171 95% 27%)',
          },
          borderRadius: {
            lg: '0.5rem',
            md: 'calc(0.5rem - 2px)',
            sm: 'calc(0.5rem - 4px)',
          },
        },
      },
    }
  </script>
</head>

<body class="font-body antialiased bg-background text-foreground">
  <%- include("./templates/header.ejs", { navigationLinks: navigationLinks, title: title }) %>

  <%- include("./templates/page_header.ejs", { 
    pageTitle: "Becas y Apoyos Financieros",
    pageDescription: "Conoce los programas de apoyo económico para que continúes tu formación profesional",
    breadcrumbs: [
      { title: "Inicio", href: "/" },
      { title: "Alumnos", href: "#" },
      { title: "Becas", href: null }
    ]
  }) %>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <!-- Introduction -->
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none mb-12">
        <p class="text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
          En la Universidad Tecnológica de Nayarit estamos comprometidos con hacer accesible la educación superior 
          de calidad. Por ello, ofrecemos diversos programas de becas y apoyos financieros para estudiantes que 
          demuestren excelencia académica, necesidad económica o habilidades destacadas.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Scholarship Types -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-8">Tipos de Becas Disponibles</h2>
        <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">
          
          <div class="rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm overflow-hidden hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
            <div class="bg-primary p-6">
              <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl font-semibold text-primary-foreground">Beca de Excelencia Académica</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6">
              <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4">
                Para estudiantes con promedio sobresaliente que mantienen un rendimiento académico destacado.
              </p>
              <div class="space-y-3">
                <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/>
                  </svg>
                  <span class="text-sm"><strong>Cobertura:</strong> 50% a 100% de colegiatura</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/>
                  </svg>
                  <span class="text-sm"><strong>Requisito:</strong> Promedio mínimo de 9.0</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/>
                  </svg>
                  <span class="text-sm"><strong>Renovable:</strong> Cuatrimestralmente</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm overflow-hidden hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
            <div class="bg-accent p-6">
              <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl font-semibold text-accent-foreground">Beca Socioeconómica</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6">
              <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4">
                Apoyo para estudiantes que enfrentan dificultades económicas y requieren asistencia financiera.
              </p>
              <div class="space-y-3">
                <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/>
                  </svg>
                  <span class="text-sm"><strong>Cobertura:</strong> 30% a 80% de colegiatura</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/>
                  </svg>
                  <span class="text-sm"><strong>Requisito:</strong> Estudio socioeconómico</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/>
                  </svg>
                  <span class="text-sm"><strong>Promedio mínimo:</strong> 8.0</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm overflow-hidden hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
            <div class="bg-secondary p-6">
              <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl font-semibold text-secondary-foreground">Beca Deportiva y Cultural</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6">
              <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4">
                Para estudiantes que destacan en actividades deportivas, artísticas o culturales.
              </p>
              <div class="space-y-3">
                <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/>
                  </svg>
                  <span class="text-sm"><strong>Cobertura:</strong> 25% a 75% de colegiatura</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/>
                  </svg>
                  <span class="text-sm"><strong>Requisito:</strong> Participación activa en equipos</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/>
                  </svg>
                  <span class="text-sm"><strong>Promedio mínimo:</strong> 8.0</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm overflow-hidden hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow">
            <div class="bg-primary/80 p-6">
              <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl font-semibold text-primary-foreground">Beca de Manutención</h3>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6">
              <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-4">
                Apoyo económico adicional para gastos de transporte, alimentación y materiales escolares.
              </p>
              <div class="space-y-3">
                <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/>
                  </svg>
                  <span class="text-sm"><strong>Monto:</strong> Variable según necesidad</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/>
                  </svg>
                  <span class="text-sm"><strong>Requisito:</strong> Situación económica vulnerable</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/>
                  </svg>
                  <span class="text-sm"><strong>Modalidad:</strong> Apoyo mensual</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- External Scholarships -->
      <div class="bg-secondary/50 rounded-lg p-8 md:p-12 mb-16">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-6">Becas Externas y Gubernamentales</h2>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-8">
          Además de nuestras becas institucionales, los estudiantes pueden aplicar a programas externos:
        </p>
        <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
          
          <div class="bg-card rounded-lg p-6 border border-border">
            <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Beca Benito Juárez</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-4">
              Programa federal para estudiantes de educación superior en situación de vulnerabilidad económica.
            </p>
            <a href="https://becasbenitojuarez.mx/" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center text-sm font-medium text-primary hover:underline">
              Más información
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="ml-1 h-4 w-4">
                <path d="M7 7h10v10"/>
                <path d="M7 17 17 7"/>
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-card rounded-lg p-6 border border-border">
            <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Beca Jóvenes Escribiendo el Futuro</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-4">
              Apoyo económico mensual para estudiantes de educación superior en todo el país.
            </p>
            <a href="https://jovenesconstruyendoelfuturo.stps.gob.mx/" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center text-sm font-medium text-primary hover:underline">
              Más información
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="ml-1 h-4 w-4">
                <path d="M7 7h10v10"/>
                <path d="M7 17 17 7"/>
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-card rounded-lg p-6 border border-border">
            <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Becas del Gobierno de Nayarit</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-4">
              Programas estatales de apoyo a la educación para estudiantes nayaritas destacados.
            </p>
            <a href="https://www.nayarit.gob.mx/" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center text-sm font-medium text-primary hover:underline">
              Más información
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="ml-1 h-4 w-4">
                <path d="M7 7h10v10"/>
                <path d="M7 17 17 7"/>
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-card rounded-lg p-6 border border-border">
            <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Becas SEP - CGUTYP</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground mb-4">
              Coordinación General de Universidades Tecnológicas y Politécnicas ofrece diversos programas.
            </p>
            <a href="http://cgutyp.sep.gob.mx/" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center text-sm font-medium text-primary hover:underline">
              Más información
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="ml-1 h-4 w-4">
                <path d="M7 7h10v10"/>
                <path d="M7 17 17 7"/>
              </svg>
            </a>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Application Process -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-8 text-center">Proceso de Solicitud</h2>
        <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-5">
          
          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="mx-auto mb-4 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-primary-foreground text-2xl font-bold">
              1
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Consulta Convocatoria</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
              Revisa fechas, requisitos y documentos necesarios
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="mx-auto mb-4 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-primary-foreground text-2xl font-bold">
              2
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Reúne Documentos</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
              Prepara toda la documentación solicitada
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="mx-auto mb-4 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-primary-foreground text-2xl font-bold">
              3
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Presenta Solicitud</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
              Entrega en el Departamento de Servicios Escolares
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="mx-auto mb-4 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-primary-foreground text-2xl font-bold">
              4
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Evaluación</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
              Análisis y validación de tu solicitud
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="text-center">
            <div class="mx-auto mb-4 flex h-16 w-16 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-primary-foreground text-2xl font-bold">
              5
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline text-lg font-semibold mb-2">Resultado</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
              Notificación de asignación de beca
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Required Documents -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-8">Documentos Generales Requeridos</h2>
        <div class="bg-card rounded-lg border border-border p-8">
          <div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 mt-1">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary">
                  <path d="M14.5 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7.5L14.5 2z"/>
                  <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <span class="text-sm">Solicitud de beca debidamente llenada</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 mt-1">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary">
                  <path d="M14.5 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7.5L14.5 2z"/>
                  <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <span class="text-sm">Copia de identificación oficial</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 mt-1">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary">
                  <path d="M14.5 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7.5L14.5 2z"/>
                  <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <span class="text-sm">Kardex o certificado de calificaciones</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 mt-1">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary">
                  <path d="M14.5 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7.5L14.5 2z"/>
                  <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <span class="text-sm">Comprobante de domicilio reciente</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 mt-1">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary">
                  <path d="M14.5 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7.5L14.5 2z"/>
                  <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <span class="text-sm">CURP actualizada</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="flex-shrink-0 mt-1">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary">
                  <path d="M14.5 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7.5L14.5 2z"/>
                  <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <span class="text-sm">Carta de motivos (según el tipo de beca)</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-6 p-4 bg-muted/50 rounded-lg">
            <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
              <strong>Nota:</strong> Los requisitos específicos pueden variar según el tipo de beca. 
              Consulta la convocatoria vigente o comunícate con el Departamento de Servicios Escolares 
              para obtener información detallada.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CTA Section -->
      <div class="text-center bg-gradient-to-br from-primary to-accent rounded-lg p-8 md:p-12">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-primary-foreground mb-4">
          ¿Necesitas Apoyo Económico?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-primary-foreground/90 mb-8 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          No permitas que la situación económica sea un obstáculo para tu educación. Conoce las opciones disponibles.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
          <a href="mailto:becas@utnay.edu.mx" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium h-11 px-8 bg-background text-foreground hover:bg-background/90">
            Solicitar Información
          </a>
          <a href="tel:+523112119800" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium h-11 px-8 border-2 border-primary-foreground text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary-foreground/10">
            Contactar a Servicios Escolares
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <%- include("./templates/footer.ejs", {title: title}) %>

</body>
</html>
